## 9. Risks & Mitigations

| Risk | Impact | Likelihood | Mitigation |
|------|--------|------------|------------|
| LLM generates generic advice despite structured data | High | Medium | Self-verification layer; prompt engineering with "evidence-based" framing; strict JSON output |
| GitHub API rate limits during evaluation | Medium | Low | Mock data fallback; rate limit handling; caching |
| Composio API unavailable or slow | Medium | Low | Mock market data; documented fallback behavior |
| LLM returns invalid JSON | Medium | Medium | Try-catch with fallback to raw data; regex extraction |
| Agent pipeline too slow for demo | Medium | Low | Use gpt-4o-mini; parallelize where possible; mock data for demo |
| Evaluation metrics are subjective | Low | Medium | Ground metrics in objective checks (skill mentions, gap coverage, evidence links) |

